                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "48dVY",
                  "name": "heading3",
                  "fill": "$--text-primary",
                  "content": "Key Findings",
                  "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Z69le",
                  "name": "para3",
                  "fill": "$--text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Our analysis reveals several important patterns in how different memory architectures handle information retrieval and storage. The episodic memory model shows particular promise for applications requiring temporal context.",
